{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21964","headline":"邓鲂张彻落第 · 白居易","name":"邓鲂张彻落第","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古琴无俗韵，奏罢无人听。\n寒松无妖花，枝下无人行。\n春风十二街，轩骑不暂停。\n奔车看牡丹，走马听秦筝。\n衆目悦芳艳，松独守其贞。\n衆耳喜郑卫，琴亦不改声。\n怀哉二夫子，念此无自轻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21964.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21964","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}